<header>
  <p class="eyebrow">Agentic data retrieval &middot; what happens behind the scenes</p>
  <h1>How The Data Gets Chosen</h1>
  <p class="lede">Anyone can hardcode a dataset URL and call it sourcing. This is the alternative: a process that <b>narrows a country&rsquo;s worth of train records down to a training deck, and writes down why at every step.</b> Every number on this page came from actually running it today.</p>
