<div class="card">''' + funnel + '''</div>
<div class="note"><b>Why throw away so much?</b> Not to save disk &mdash; we have the disk. It is that a training example is only worth something if it is not a copy of one you already have. A train that calls at a stop twice a month teaches almost nothing; a station a thousand kilometres from Munich teaches nothing about Munich. Volume is cheap. Distinct, relevant examples are not.</div>

<p class="side">Step two</p>
<p class="sidesub">Everything rejected, and why</p>
<p class="intro">This is the part most pipelines skip. A system that only records what it <em>kept</em> gives you no way to tell careful selection from a lucky guess.</p>
