<div class="wrap">
<header>
  <p class="eyebrow">The agentic bit, plainly</p>
  <h1>Agents Propose, Code Disposes</h1>
  <p class="lede">A language model is used in six places in this pipeline. In every one of them it is allowed to <b>suggest</b> and never to <b>decide</b> &mdash; something dumb and deterministic checks the suggestion against the actual data, and a wrong guess is thrown away rather than trusted.</p>
